OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize cars in crackdown on 
OL,4,Apavement parking                       
OL,6,FPolice have seized two vehicles and    
OL,7,Fissued about 30 warning notices during 
OL,8,Fa crackdown on pavement parking.       
OL,10,FOfficers from a neighbourhood policing 
OL,11,Fteam carried out patrols in West Cotton
OL,12,FClose, Cotton End, Northampton, after  
OL,13,Fresidents complained.                  
OL,15,FPolice said pedestrians, including     
OL,16,Fwheelchair users and people with       
OL,17,Fpushchairs, had been forced into the   
OL,18,Froad to get past inconsiderately parked
OL,19,Fcars.                                  
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
