OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize cars in crackdown on 
OL,4,Apavement parking                       
OL,6,FThe force said the area's proximity to 
OL,7,Fthe town centre and the university,    
OL,8,Fcoupled with limited parking spaces and
OL,9,Fa lack of yellow lines, may have made  
OL,10,Fthe problem worse.                     
